---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CopySnippet from '../components/CopySnippet.astro';
import { VALID_LANGUAGES } from '../lib/project-languages.js';
const sample = `name: Your Agent
slug: your-agent
tagline: "An assistant that organizes your notes"
description: "Give it a folder of notes and ask for a reading list."
language: python
category: [personal-assistant]
github: owner/repo
quick_start: https://example.com/getting-started
first_task: "Ask it to list the topics in a sample folder of notes."
status: active
ecosystem_role: alternative
highlight: "Lets you review the list before saving it"
emoji: "🦀"
added: "${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}"`;
---
<Layout title="Suggest an agent — Shelldex" description="Tell us about an open-source agent you've used. Share its setup guide and a task it can carry out." robots="noindex, follow">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-5 sm:px-8 py-12"><article class="max-w-3xl space-y-8">
<header><p class="font-mono text-sm text-ledger-red">CONTRIBUTE</p><h1 class="my-4">Suggest an agent<span class="text-ledger-red">.</span></h1><p class="text-lg">What can you ask it to do? Send us the project, a link that shows how to run it, and one task a newcomer can try.</p></header>
<a class="sd-primary" href="https://github.com/daveonkels/clawdex/issues/new?template=new-project.yml">Suggest an agent on GitHub →</a>
<p>No code changes are needed. The form requires a GitHub account. A human checks each suggestion before adding it.</p>
<section><h2 class="mb-2">Does it belong here?</h2><p>You must be able to give the shipped assistant a goal and have it take actions. OpenClaw and Hermes Agent qualify. A library, dashboard, deployment wrapper or plugin for another agent doesn’t. We look for public, runnable code. Paid-only services, duplicates and README-only proposals don’t qualify.</p></section>
<details class="p-5 border border-ledger-border rounded-xl bg-white"><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer py-3">Contributing a catalog entry yourself?</summary>
<p class="my-4">Fork <a class="underline" href="https://github.com/daveonkels/clawdex">the repository</a>, add <code>src/data/projects/your-agent.yml</code> and open a pull request. Use a concrete example and an upstream setup link. The validator accepts these languages: {VALID_LANGUAGES.join(', ')}.</p>
<CopySnippet value={sample} label="YAML template" />
<a class="underline" href="https://github.com/daveonkels/clawdex/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Full contributor guide →</a></details>
<p>Already listed? <a class="underline" href="/badges/">Get a badge for your README</a> or <a class="underline" href="/methodology/#corrections">suggest a correction</a>.</p>
</article></div></Layout>
